  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Tokenized stocks distributed value rose 12.9% over 30D:</strong> Tokenized equity distributed value at $3.42B (12.9% higher over 30D) shows the early lane still adding balance sheet on a small set of platforms. Related: <a href=\"https://www.coindesk.com/business/2026/10/18/sec-tokenized-stock-framework-faces-issuer-pushback-as-broadcom-verizon-object-to-okx-ice-listing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">SEC tokenized stock framework faces issuer pushback as Broadcom, Verizon object to OKX-ICE listing</a> (CoinDesk).</li><li><strong>Tokenized stocks remain an early-stage lane:</strong> liquidity and scale are still concentrated in a small set of platforms/networks. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/public-companies-object-okx-ice-tokenized-stock?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Public companies object to OKX-ICE\u2019s tokenized stock plan</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li><li><strong>Tokenized equities remain an early access market:</strong> Liquidity and scale stay concentrated until broker distribution and custody plumbing can support broader trading. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/markets/2026-10-17-coreweave-broadcom-verizon-among-nine-companies-objecting-to-tokenized-trading-of-their-shares-on-okxice-418859\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">CoreWeave, Broadcom, Verizon among nine companies objecting to tokenized trading of their shares on OKXICE</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Regulatory framing still decides product access:</strong> Securities and broker-rule constraints often set the pace more than listing count, so 